WEBVTT

00:03:59.160 --> 00:04:00.856
But little did I know

00:04:00.880 --> 00:04:04.296
I was receiving the greatest gifts
I had ever dreamed of:

00:04:04.320 --> 00:04:05.520
self-worth,

00:04:06.320 --> 00:04:08.160
knowledge, discipline.

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:12.696
I was so excited to be reading that I read
everything I could get my hands on:

00:04:12.720 --> 00:04:16.055
candy wrappers, clothing logos,
street signs, everything.

00:04:16.079 --> 00:04:17.296
I was just reading stuff!

00:04:17.320 --> 00:04:18.336
(Applause)

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:19.560
Just reading stuff.

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:24.160
I was so excited to know how to read
and know how to spell.

00:04:24.720 --> 00:04:26.976
The homey came up, said,
"Man, what you eating?"

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:28.736
I said, "C-A-N-D-Y, candy."

00:04:28.760 --> 00:04:31.016
(Laughter)